{"id":"geography-p007","bookId":"geography","number":7,"title":"四、降水的类型","width":1190.55,"height":841.89,"image":"data/knowledge/pages/geography/geography-p007.svg","dataUrl":"data/knowledge/pages/geography/geography-p007.json","questionCount":25,"version":1,"imagePixels":[2084,1474],"source":{"file":"27上岸村·地理常识思维导图.pdf","sha256":"576c24491978fba592409bedecc27d6a415071de09308954a9b57b19ed8093f2","page":7},"nodes":[{"id":"geography-p007-n0001","text":"四、降水的类型","bbox":[80.918,344.506,114.245,16.321],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.321,"block":0,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0002","text":"对流雨","bbox":[285.683,85.14,43.522,14.507],"color":"#e32c2d","fontSize":14.507,"block":1,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0003","text":"对流雨，也叫热雷雨，是近地面空气局部受热或高层空气强烈降温，导致上","bbox":[363.66,31.644,478.742,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":2,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0004","text":"下层空气发生对流，使低层空气上升，水汽在高空冷却、凝结而形成的雨","bbox":[363.66,53.405,464.235,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":2,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0005","text":"强烈的对流雨常伴有","bbox":[363.66,95.113,130.566,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0006","text":"强风、雷电、冰雹或龙卷","bbox":[494.226,95.113,159.581,14.507],"color":"#e32c2d","fontSize":14.507,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0007","text":"，但","bbox":[653.807,95.113,29.015,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0008","text":"雨时较短","bbox":[682.821,95.113,58.029,14.507],"color":"#e53935","fontSize":14.507,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0009","text":"，雨区","bbox":[740.851,95.113,43.522,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0010","text":"范围也较小","bbox":[784.373,95.113,72.537,14.507],"color":"#e53935","fontSize":14.507,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0011","text":"，","bbox":[856.909,95.113,14.507,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0012","text":"或呈不连续的条块分布。多发生在","bbox":[363.66,116.875,217.61,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":4,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0013","text":"夏季","bbox":[581.27,116.875,29.015,14.507],"color":"#e32c2d","fontSize":14.507,"block":4,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0014","text":"酷热的午后。","bbox":[610.285,116.875,87.044,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":4,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0015","text":"赤道地带全年以对流雨为主","bbox":[697.329,116.875,174.088,14.507],"color":"#e32c2d","fontSize":14.507,"block":4,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0016","text":"地形雨","bbox":[285.683,178.531,43.522,14.507],"color":"#ff6f00","fontSize":14.507,"block":5,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0017","text":"当潮湿的气团前进时，遇到高山阻挡，气流被迫缓慢上升，引起绝热降温，发生凝结而形成的降水。","bbox":[363.66,156.77,638.323,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":6,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0018","text":"地形雨多降在","bbox":[363.66,178.531,87.044,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":6,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0019","text":"迎风面的山坡（迎风坡）","bbox":[450.704,178.531,159.581,14.507],"color":"#ff6f00","fontSize":14.507,"block":6,"line":1,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0020","text":"上，背风坡面则因空气下沉引起绝热增温，反使云量消减，降雨减少","bbox":[610.285,178.531,435.22,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":6,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0021","text":"锋面雨","bbox":[285.683,264.668,43.522,14.507],"color":"#1e88e5","fontSize":14.507,"block":7,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0022","text":"冷、暖两种性质不同的气团相遇时，暖湿空气被抬升，在高空冷却凝结而形成的降水","bbox":[363.66,222.959,536.772,14.507],"color":"#000000","fontSize":14.507,"block":8,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0023","text":"雨势通常比较","bbox":[363.66,264.668,87.044,14.507],"color":"#000000","fontSize":14.507,"block":9,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0024","text":"和缓","bbox":[450.704,264.668,29.015,14.507],"color":"#1e88e5","fontSize":14.507,"block":9,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0025","text":"。降水区域呈带状分布，","bbox":[479.719,264.668,159.581,14.507],"color":"#000000","fontSize":14.507,"block":9,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0026","text":"水平范围很大","bbox":[639.299,264.668,87.044,14.507],"color":"#1e88e5","fontSize":14.507,"block":9,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0027","text":"降雨","bbox":[363.66,306.377,29.015,14.507],"color":"#000000","fontSize":14.507,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0028","text":"持续时间较长","bbox":[392.674,306.377,87.044,14.507],"color":"#1e88e5","fontSize":14.507,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0029","text":"，短则几天，长则半个月以上。常见的有","bbox":[479.719,306.377,261.132,14.507],"color":"#000000","fontSize":14.507,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0030","text":"梅雨、春雨","bbox":[740.851,306.377,72.537,14.507],"color":"#1e88e5","fontSize":14.507,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0031","text":"等","bbox":[813.387,306.377,14.507,14.507],"color":"#000000","fontSize":14.507,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0032","text":"台风雨","bbox":[285.683,367.126,43.522,14.507],"color":"#19a719","fontSize":14.507,"block":11,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0033","text":"是由热带气旋","bbox":[363.66,346.272,87.044,14.507],"color":"#000000","fontSize":14.507,"block":12,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0034","text":"(","bbox":[450.704,340.912,4.628,14.507],"color":"#000000","fontSize":14.507,"block":12,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0035","text":"台风或飓风","bbox":[455.337,346.272,72.537,14.507],"color":"#000000","fontSize":14.507,"block":12,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0036","text":")","bbox":[527.873,340.912,4.628,14.507],"color":"#000000","fontSize":14.507,"block":12,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0037","text":"带来的降水，降水主要集中在台风眼周围的","bbox":[532.506,346.272,275.639,14.507],"color":"#000000","fontSize":14.507,"block":12,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0038","text":"“","bbox":[808.145,340.912,5.02,14.507],"color":"#19a719","fontSize":14.507,"block":12,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0039","text":"云墙区","bbox":[813.175,346.272,43.522,14.507],"color":"#19a719","fontSize":14.507,"block":12,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0040","text":"”","bbox":[856.697,340.912,5.02,14.507],"color":"#19a719","fontSize":14.507,"block":12,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0041","text":"，这里上升气流最强，","bbox":[861.726,346.272,145.073,14.507],"color":"#000000","fontSize":14.507,"block":12,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0042","text":"降雨最猛烈","bbox":[1006.8,346.272,72.537,14.507],"color":"#19a719","fontSize":14.507,"block":12,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0043","text":"而","bbox":[363.66,387.98,14.507,14.507],"color":"#000000","fontSize":14.507,"block":13,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0044","text":"台风眼内部","bbox":[378.167,387.98,72.537,14.507],"color":"#19a719","fontSize":14.507,"block":13,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0045","text":"气流下沉，通常是晴朗无风的，主要影响热带、亚热带沿海地区，多发生在","bbox":[450.704,387.98,478.742,14.507],"color":"#000000","fontSize":14.507,"block":13,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0046","text":"夏秋","bbox":[929.446,387.98,29.015,14.507],"color":"#19a719","fontSize":14.507,"block":13,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0047","text":"季节","bbox":[958.461,387.98,29.015,14.507],"color":"#000000","fontSize":14.507,"block":13,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0048","text":"【知识延伸】","bbox":[257.273,570.796,87.044,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":14,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0049","text":"梅雨","bbox":[378.772,479.558,29.015,14.507],"color":"#ce4289","fontSize":14.507,"block":15,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0050","text":"是在","bbox":[442.241,437.849,29.015,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":16,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0051","text":"每年","bbox":[471.256,437.849,29.015,14.507],"color":"#ce4289","fontSize":14.507,"block":16,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0052","text":"6","bbox":[500.271,432.419,12.288,14.507],"color":"#ce4289","fontSize":14.507,"block":16,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0053","text":"、","bbox":[512.561,437.849,14.507,14.507],"color":"#ce4289","fontSize":14.507,"block":16,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0054","text":"7","bbox":[527.068,432.419,11.461,14.507],"color":"#ce4289","fontSize":14.507,"block":16,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0055","text":"月份","bbox":[538.529,437.849,29.015,14.507],"color":"#ce4289","fontSize":14.507,"block":16,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0056","text":"的东南季风带来的太平洋暖湿气流","bbox":[567.551,437.849,217.61,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":16,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0057","text":"经过","bbox":[442.241,479.558,29.015,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":17,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0058","text":"中国长江中下游地区、中国台湾地区","bbox":[471.256,479.558,232.117,14.507],"color":"#ce4289","fontSize":14.507,"block":17,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0059","text":"、日本中南部以及韩国南部等地出现的持续天阴有雨的气候现象","bbox":[703.373,479.558,406.205,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":17,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0060","text":"由于正是江南梅子的成熟期，故称其为","bbox":[442.241,521.267,246.625,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":18,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0061","text":"“","bbox":[688.866,515.906,5.02,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":18,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0062","text":"梅雨","bbox":[693.888,521.267,29.015,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":18,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0063","text":"”","bbox":[722.903,515.906,5.02,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":18,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0064","text":"暴雨","bbox":[378.772,662.033,29.015,14.507],"color":"#0096bf","fontSize":14.507,"block":19,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0065","text":"1.","bbox":[442.241,599.324,8.11,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":20,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p007-n0066","text":"等级划分","bbox":[450.338,604.684,58.029,14.507],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.507,"block":20,"line":0,"e